==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Netherworld Nymph Lunacia (Uber Rare Cat)|Death's Daughter Lunacia]]: With her Explosion Immunity, Weaken vs. Aku and Traitless, and a piercing Explosion of her own, Lunacia works great against Akaza and his peons.
*[[Tanjiro Kamado (Uber Rare Cat)|Tanjiro Kamado CC]]: Tanjiro just outrages Akaza's Explosion, allowing him to deal considerable damage over time with great pierce to pick off the enemies hiding behind the boss.
*[[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Aphrodite]]: Fulfills a similar role to Tanjiro, albeit with less pierce and slightly worse survivability thanks to the lack of Explosion and Survive respectively.

